      </figure>
      </div>

      <div class="stack" style="grid-area:i">
      <figure class="piece wide">
        <div class="mount text"><blockquote>Make it not any longer a matter of dispute or discourse, what are the signs and proprieties of a good man, but really and actually to be such.</blockquote></div>
        <figcaption class="cartel"><span class="no">No. 8</span><span><i>Meditations</i>, Marcus Aurelius · book X</span></figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="piece wide">
        <div class="mount text big dark"><blockquote>Simplify, simplify.</blockquote></div>
        <figcaption class="cartel"><span class="no">No. 8a</span><span><i>Walden</i>, Henry David Thoreau · ch. 2</span></figcaption>
      </figure>
